253501925", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974820_1302819256835258_1514330594747332623_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AXfJLT4ya5oQ7kNvwGOpkGi&_nc_oc=Adk8yN9j38Sj1A5CW0Q5egaX6KznLFo0v1rfddBREcjg_dXrK5ZhoiochSdDpE4eQVA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxfZwwEaqtXx1y4gBxYAPbxgZadByCV43pf0_K3rjR3zw&oe=69B419DC"}, "display_name": "XR MANGA  FIST OF THE NORTHSTAR\u3010The First Edition\u3011Volume 1-6 Set", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The immortal masterpiece \"Fist of the North Star\", which has enthusiastic fans all over the world, is now available as the first installment of the XR Manga series!\nYou can read \"Fist of the North Star\" like never before in a VR space that perfectly reproduces the world view.\nYou can also enjoy the rhythm game \"I am Kenshiro\" where you can become Kenshiro yourself, and \"VR Figure\" where you can play with Kenshiro as a VR figure.", "short_description": "The immortal masterpiece \"Fist of the North Star\", which has enthusiastic fans all over the world, is now available as the first installment of the XR Manga series!\nYou can read \"Fist of the North Star\" like never before in a VR space that perfectly reproduces the world view.\nYou can also enjoy the rhythm game \"I am Kenshiro\" where you can become Kenshiro yourself, and \"VR Figure\" where you can play with Kenshiro as a VR figure."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "292129582746601", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "XR\u30de\u30f3\u30ac \u5317\u6597\u306e\u62f3\u3010The First Edition\u30111-6\u5dfb\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u4e16\u754c\u4e2d\u306b\u71b1\u72c2\u7684\u306a\u30d5\u30a1\u30f3\u3092\u6301\u3064\u4e0d\u673d\u306e\u540d\u4f5c\u300c\u5317\u6597\u306e\u62f3\u300d\u304cXR\u30de\u30f3\u30ac\u30b7\u30ea\u30fc\u30ba\u7b2c\u4e00\u5f3e\u3068\u3057\u3066\u767b\u5834\uff01\n\u4e16\u